---
import Prose from '../layouts/Prose.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Prose title="Privacy policy" description={`How ${SITE.name} handles your data, cookies and advertising.`} path="privacy-policy/" updated="10 November 2026">
  <p>This policy explains what information {SITE.name} collects when you use this website, and how it is used. If you have questions, email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Usage data.</strong> We use web analytics to understand which pages are read and how people find the site. This includes pages visited, approximate location (country or city), device and browser type, and referring websites. We do not use it to identify you personally.</li>
    <li><strong>Information you send us.</strong> If you email us or subscribe to updates, we keep your email address and message so we can reply or send what you asked for. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
    <li><strong>Search.</strong> Searches on this site run in your browser and are not stored by us.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>Cookies are small files stored by your browser. We and our partners may use cookies for analytics and, once enabled, for advertising. You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings; the site still works without them.</p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>This site may show ads served by Google AdSense and other ad partners. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your previous visits to this and other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visits to this site and other sites on the internet.</p>
  <p>You can opt out of personalised advertising in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>, and learn more at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="noopener" target="_blank">How Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>. You can also opt out of some third-party vendors' cookies at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices" rel="noopener" target="_blank">aboutads.info</a>.</p>

  <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
  <p>Some links are affiliate links. If you buy through them, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. The partner may use cookies to record the referral. See our advertising disclosure.</p>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share data only with service providers that run the site (hosting, analytics, email, advertising), and when required by law.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is meant for adults and is not directed at children under 13.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. The "last updated" date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>
</Prose>
